### Finding: Reachability & Attacker Control
**Risk Level**: High
**Data Flow Path**: JavaScript -> `JavaScriptBridgeInterface`._callHandler(String, String, String)
**Technical Description**: The method `_callHandler` is exposed to any JavaScript code running in the WebView. If an attacker has control over the JavaScript environment, they can call this method with arbitrary input.
**Evidence**: 
```java
public void _callHandler(String handlerName, String methodName, String args) {
    // No validation or sanitization of the inputs
}
```

